  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia - Sustaining Tropical Forests for Climate, Nature and People</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2025, agribusiness companies* , financial institutions and other key Non State Actors- NSA in Colombia implement policy instruments** that enhance their contribution to national deforestation/conversion -free commitments 
 
 *companies from targeted supply chains: beef, dairy, cocoa, palm oil
 ** Policy instruments: Zero Deforestation/Conversion Agreements (voluntary commitments from private sector agribusiness); Strategic plans for business management measures; AFi guidelines.</narrative>
  </description>
